        "steam_appid": 3649660,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think &quot;light work&quot; sounds simple and easy? Many people might be surprised to find out what it truly involves. Experience the harsh reality of &quot;light work&quot; through this simulator!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, grab a cardboard box, place it on your workstation, and mark the shipping sheet. You must only mark the sheet if food items are present, then place it on the shipping caster!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of the boxes are completely random! Of course, if even one item is incorrect, you must not ship it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D action game easily operated with a keyboard and mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've designed realistic backgrounds and 3D models to immerse you in the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a comprehensive tutorial guide to help you learn the game mechanics and tips.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think &quot;light work&quot; sounds simple and easy? Many people might be surprised to find out what it truly involves. Experience the harsh reality of &quot;light work&quot; through this simulator!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, grab a cardboard box, place it on your workstation, and mark the shipping sheet. You must only mark the sheet if food items are present, then place it on the shipping caster!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of the boxes are completely random! Of course, if even one item is incorrect, you must not ship it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D action game easily operated with a keyboard and mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've designed realistic backgrounds and 3D models to immerse you in the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a comprehensive tutorial guide to help you learn the game mechanics and tips.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A work-style action game focused on endless inspection in a cold refrigerator. Use gloves to handle frozen products and mark documents with numb hands. Simple, repetitive action without chores or heavy lifting.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean",
